//   Checked: oppositions Mars 16. 1. 2025, Jupiter 10. 1. 2026, Saturn 21. 9. 2025, Uranus 21. 11. 2025 within 0,5°,
//   Earth perihelion 3. 1. 2026 = 147,10 mio km, aphelion 6. 7. 2026 = 152,10 mio km.
