//   Uranus 97,8°, Sun 7,25° to the ecliptic). Mars uses the 2009 pole (317,681°, 52,887°), Neptune its 2026 value.
// - Moon: mean elements after P. Schlyter »How to compute planetary positions« (a = 384400 km, e = 0,0549,
